OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fat first but soon clouding over from
OL,7,Fthe west through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight with outbreaks of rain,
OL,9,Fturning heavy at times. Becoming
OL,10,Fbreezy towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy at first with some
OL,13,Flight rain or drizzle. Staying mostly
OL,14,Fcloudy through the day with further
OL,15,Frain or showers, heavy at times, but
OL,16,Fthe odd brighter spell possible.
OL,17,FBreezy.
